  "scientific_status": "The stage reconstructs the background-subtracted bilocal covariance from the completed common-J memory kernel. Contractive background dilation and L2/L8 interpolation control the strong return error by O(p^(-1/3)) on compact real-time windows. Charged coefficients simplify and neutral coefficients have a regular divided-difference representation.",
